.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-deploy-key-get \- Returns a single deploy key specified by the ID.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab deploy-key get  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Pass the ID of the key to return as an argument. Find key IDs by
running \fBglab deploy-key list --show-id\fR\&. Use \fB--repo\fR to target a
project other than the current one.

.PP
By default, the command prints the key's title, public key, push access,
and creation date. Use \fB--output json\fR to return the full key object.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression.

.PP
\fB-F\fP, \fB--output\fP="text"
	Format output as: text, json.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# Get deploy key with ID as argument
glab deploy-key get 1234
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-deploy-key(1)\fP
